> How many teleport wand zaps should I have on the planes to be safe 20?
> 50?100?

I tend to play it safe and bring more than I need, especially since
the weight of a wand is pretty light.  You might only need 10 zaps if
you are judicious about their use, but if you're travelling to
multiple altars you might need more.  It depends a lot on whether you
have conflict or not.  With conflict I can get across the plane of air
without killing anything and using 1-4 zaps.  Fire, water and earth
usually don't take any, but maybe figure 1 zap on each (especially if
you genocide ;).  Astral maybe takes 5 zaps to go from the corridor to
an altar.  So, 50 would be way overkill, 20 would probably mean using
them sparingly.  That's based on somewhat limited experience but
teleport zaps have worked very well for me.

